{"at": "2026-10-13T13:06:06.454365+00:00", "data": {"source_step": 2, "status": "observed", "text": "crypto_factor 真机(Kali 桥)返回 n 的唯一素因子指数为 5，product_matches=true、complete=true → 确认 n = p^5，p 为 256-bit 素数。"}, "files": [], "kind": "note", "previous": "fda263d205a8f66b5b7706ccad9eb4d7b318f14cc6a736bd3af4b11e15fa6874", "seq": 5, "sha256": "6a198d285fff93bb9f800aa604ac79e3ce5262552ca1f8dd3da5fa09da474258"}
{"at": "2026-10-13T13:06:06.485499+00:00", "data": {"source_step": null, "status": "hypothesis", "text": "关键判断：n 是素数幂 → φ(n)=p^(k-1)(p-1)；又 e | (p-1) 且 gcd(e,(p-1)/e)=1 → 标准 RSA 求 d 会报 base is not invertible，必须改用 e 次根。"}, "files": [], "kind": "note", "previous": "6a198d285fff93bb9f800aa604ac79e3ce5262552ca1f8dd3da5fa09da474258", "seq": 6, "sha256": "807eba17d3b93cdac1d2426f70c179a4268faf91d29891e4a4a2ec70d0a6d575"}
{"at": "2026-10-13T13:06:06.519306+00:00", "data": {"source_step": 3, "status": "observed", "text": "用 math_modpow 复算 root^e mod n，返回值与 out.txt 的 c 逐位一致 → 该根即明文 m，其字节串含 flag{...} 前缀。"}, "files": [], "kind": "note", "previous": "807eba17d3b93cdac1d2426f70c179a4268faf91d29891e4a4a2ec70d0a6d575", "seq": 7, "sha256": "1be234e1ea5bfe1117e139c5c9db4af6e5d6d3501281b8d1eeb29d3ec4a4a0f8"}
{"at": "2026-10-13T13:06:27.329869+00:00", "data": {"source_step": 2, "status": "observed", "text": "附件证据：out.txt 给 n(1279-bit)/e=641747/c；task.py 显示 m=bytes_to_long(flag + 随机填充到 158 字节)，c=m^e mod n。"}, "files": [], "kind": "note", "previous": "1be234e1ea5bfe1117e139c5c9db4af6e5d6d3501281b8d1eeb29d3ec4a4a0f8", "seq": 8, "sha256": "d9f809b820001bc8ebf9dad60109d8f135d736101dc52f5b021127331a4f3515"}
